      ],
      "summary_en": "Fiddlesticks damaging enemies with spells while unseen or targeting an enemy with Terrify's activation strikes a target unit with fear, causing it to flee in terror for a duration.",
      "summary_zh": "费德提克在非战斗状态且未被敌人看见时，如果用技能对敌人造成了伤害，或者对一名敌人使用了【Q恐惧】的主动效果，都会使目标因害怕而逃跑一段时间。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307119:4052374"
      ]
